From 3adb8e368e2f7265ba9278397657c0006b49c68c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leonieziechmann <48921293+leonieziechmann@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:35:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] feat(data): contract core, invoice(data:, custom:)
 re-entry, rows engine, payment(..)

Consolidated prototype of the unified data-hydration design (SYNTHESIS.md):
descriptor-driven decoder and JSON Schema export (design D, trimmed to the
invoice-pro/1 format), re-entry precedence in invoice(), design C's bulk
rows engine behind the implicit items slot and the explicit marker, design
B's payment(..) block with the paid-by-transfer account, region VAT rates,
sealed ctx.custom and a lazy result record.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RaaQussN1QVEE8zRWeeCD3
